Z||000002||WampusCat||12-06-2000||11:10 AM||||When I was a senior in high school(79), most of the car guys had chevelles and camaros but this one oddball had a 70's celica GT.  He was kind of the school joke until a few guys tried to follow him through the twisties.  They learned to only mess with him on the long straights!  That's a nice looking one but It's a little too low for my taste.  There's a cherry yellow 77GT right around the corner from my house.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Tigger||12-06-2000||11:25 AM||||Don't see too many of those around here.  I like the slung low stance.  Sorta see some hints of Mustang and Camaro from around that era in it, maybe even a little early '70 Chevelle too.<P>Purdy neat<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fformula88||12-06-2000||07:04 PM||||Wow, I don't think I have ever seen one of those!  Of course, I was born in '77 and really wasn't too into cars at the time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I like the low slung stance.  Reminds me a bit of older Camaro/Mustangs too!  Looks sweet!||||reg||1
