Z||000006||Black88GT||12-07-2000||04:37 PM||||It does look kind of like an older F-body but with a Toyota touch.  I have never even seen one, I thought they came out with Celica's in the 80s to be honest with you.<P>What is that really old Toyota, starts with a "C" and they said it really made people change their minds about foreign stuff because it was so reliable.  I can't seem to remember it, I saw it on a 100 greatest cars show on A&E.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
