Z||000010||alpha||12-07-2000||10:17 PM||||I am sure Black88GT is thinking of the Corona.<P>The Celica came out in 1971 and it has always been called Celica.<P>There was a rather interesting article in the October 2000 issue of Grassroots Motorsports recounting the history of the Celica.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://fiero.dhs.org/fiero/sig.jpg">   <BR>   <A HREF="mailto:douglas_knight@umit.maine.edu">douglas_knight@umit.maine.edu</A> ||||reg||1
